  "notes": "改善 iOS 连接、订阅配置恢复和到期提醒。\n\n- 修复部分重新签名安装后无法识别 VPN 扩展的问题，并明确不同签名方式的 VPN 权限要求。\n- 刷新订阅时重新下载已损坏的缓存配置，拒绝用无效内容覆盖原有可用配置。\n- 补全桌面连接失败的诊断日志，便于定位底层连接问题。\n- 统一到期提醒，在应用重启后继续记住已处理的提醒。\n- 流量提醒按账号和当前流量周期判断，减少重复提醒；请求结果不明确时不会重复发送。\n- 切换账号、退出登录或更新流量周期后，取消过期提醒。\n- 继续遵循你的提醒开关和系统通知权限；无法确认权限时不会擅自开启通知。\n",
  "notesEn": "Improve iOS connections, subscription recovery and reminders.\n\n- Recognize the installed VPN extension after re-signing and clarify the VPN permissions required by different signing methods.\n- Re-download damaged subscription caches on refresh and keep usable configurations when a response contains invalid content.\n- Include the correct desktop connection logs for more useful failure diagnostics.\n- Unify expiry reminders and remember handled events across app restarts.\n- Match quota reminders to the account and current allowance cycle, reducing duplicate attempts when a request has an uncertain result.\n- Cancel outdated reminders after switching accounts, signing out or starting a new allowance cycle.\n- Respect your reminder preference and system notification permission. An unknown permission state never enables notifications automatically.\n",
